[SIZE=6][B]ZonelyCore API Quick Reference[/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE=2]All examples assume ZonelyCore is enabled and your plugin depends on it.[/SIZE]

[B]Accessing the API[/B]
[CODE=java]
import dev.zonely.whiteeffect.api.ZonelyCoreAPI;

public final class MyAddon {

    private ZonelyCoreAPI api;

    public void onEnable() {
        api = ZonelyCoreAPI.get(); // safe once ZonelyCore is enabled
    }
}
[/CODE]

[B]Checking Module Toggles[/B]
[CODE=java]
if (!api.areVouchersEnabled()) {
    getLogger().warning("Vouchers module disabled, skipping custom voucher logic.");
}

if (api.areLastCreditsEnabled()) {
    getLogger().info("Last credits module active – holograms and GUI calls are safe.");
}
[/CODE]

[HR][/HR]

[B]Cash API[/B]
[LIST]
[*] [ICODE]getBalance(name|player)[/ICODE] returns the current credit total (offline-safe).
[*] [ICODE]addBalance[/ICODE], [ICODE]withdraw[/ICODE], [ICODE]setBalance[/ICODE] return the updated balance and throw [ICODE]CreditOperationException[/ICODE] on failure (insufficient funds, DB issues, validation errors).
[*] [ICODE]isCached[/ICODE] / [ICODE]invalidateCache[/ICODE] let you manage the in-memory cache after manual DB edits.
[*] Async helpers ([ICODE]addBalanceAsync[/ICODE], [ICODE]withdrawAsync[/ICODE], [ICODE]setBalanceAsync[/ICODE]) complete on a [ICODE]CompletableFuture<Long>[/ICODE] so you can stay off the main thread.
[/LIST]
[CODE=java]
import dev.zonely.whiteeffect.api.cash.CashAPI;
import dev.zonely.whiteeffect.api.cash.CreditOperationException;

CashAPI cash = api.cash();

try {
    long updated = cash.addBalance("PlayerOne", 500);
    long remaining = cash.withdraw("PlayerTwo", 250);
    cash.setBalance("PlayerVIP", 10_000);
    getLogger().info("Balances updated: " + updated + " / " + remaining);
} catch (CreditOperationException ex) {
    getLogger().warning("Credit operation failed: " + ex.getMessage());
}

cash.addBalanceAsync("AsyncGuy", 1000).thenAccept(newBalance ->
        Bukkit.getScheduler().runTask(plugin, () -> {
            Player player = Bukkit.getPlayerExact("AsyncGuy");
            if (player != null) {
                player.sendMessage("Yeni bakiyen: " + newBalance);
            }
        })
);
[/CODE]

[HR][/HR]

[B]Voucher API[/B]
[LIST]
[*] [ICODE]issueVoucher(issuer, target, amount)[/ICODE] deducts credits and returns a [ICODE]VoucherIssueResult[/ICODE] (item + metadata).
[*] [ICODE]parseVoucher(item)[/ICODE] inspects items safely, [ICODE]redeemVoucher(details|item)[/ICODE] credits the target.
[*] Throws [ICODE]CreditOperationException[/ICODE] for validation problems (e.g. insufficient funds).
[/LIST]
[CODE=java]
import dev.zonely.whiteeffect.api.voucher.VoucherAPI;
import dev.zonely.whiteeffect.api.voucher.VoucherIssueResult;

VoucherAPI vouchers = api.vouchers();

try {
    VoucherIssueResult voucher = vouchers.issueVoucher("Staff", "PlayerTwo", 250);
    player.getInventory().addItem(voucher.getVoucherItem());
    vouchers.redeemVoucher(voucher.getDetails());
} catch (CreditOperationException ex) {
    getLogger().warning("Voucher error: " + ex.getMessage());
}
[/CODE]

[HR][/HR]

[B]Deliveries API[/B]
[LIST]
[*] [ICODE]listDeliveries()[/ICODE] exposes configured reward entries.
[*] [ICODE]getStatus(player, delivery)[/ICODE] describes permission/cooldown; [ICODE]claim(player, delivery)[/ICODE] performs the reward (throws [ICODE]CreditOperationException[/ICODE] on profile load failures).
[/LIST]
[CODE=java]
api.deliveries().listDeliveries().forEach(delivery -> {
    api.deliveries().getStatus(player, delivery).ifPresent(status -> {
        if (status.canClaimNow()) {
            try {
                api.deliveries().claim(player, delivery);
            } catch (CreditOperationException ex) {
                player.sendMessage("Delivery failed: " + ex.getMessage());
            }
        }
    });
});
[/CODE]

[HR][/HR]

[B]Last Credits API[/B]
[LIST]
[*] [ICODE]getLeaderboard(category)[/ICODE] returns cached entries (RECENT, ALL_TIME, YEARLY, MONTHLY, DAILY).
[*] [ICODE]getLastLeaderboardRefresh(category)[/ICODE] exposes snapshot freshness.
[*] [ICODE]getRecentTopups()[/ICODE] mirrors the PlaceholderAPI cache.
[*] [ICODE]getViewerCategory(player)[/ICODE] / [ICODE]setViewerCategory(player, category)[/ICODE] keep holograms & GUI aligned per player.
[*] [ICODE]openMenu(player, category)[/ICODE] honours the viewer’s active category (pass [ICODE]getViewerCategory[/ICODE] to stay in sync).
[/LIST]
[CODE=java]
var recent = api.lastCredits().getLeaderboard(LastCreditsMenuManager.Category.RECENT);
recent.forEach(entry ->
        Bukkit.getLogger().info(entry.getPosition() + ". " + entry.getUsername() + " -> " + entry.getFormattedAmount())
);

LastCreditsMenuManager.Category active = api.lastCredits().getViewerCategory(player);
api.lastCredits().openMenu(player, active);
[/CODE]

[HR][/HR]

[B]Secure Socket API[/B]
[LIST]
[*] Controlled by `config.yml` (`web-token`, `socket-port`); modules toggle must be enabled.
[*] [ICODE]start()[/ICODE], [ICODE]stop()[/ICODE], [ICODE]restart()[/ICODE] manage the listener; [ICODE]isActive()[/ICODE] and [ICODE]getPort()[/ICODE] expose runtime state.
[/LIST]
[CODE=java]
if (api.isSocketEnabled()) {
    if (!api.socket().isActive()) {
        if (!api.socket().start()) {
            getLogger().warning("Secure socket could not start. Check config.yml.");
        }
    } else {
        api.socket().restart();
    }
}
[/CODE]

[HR][/HR]

[B]Auction API[/B]
[LIST]
[*] [ICODE]openMainMenu[/ICODE], [ICODE]openSoldMenu[/ICODE], [ICODE]openPurchasedMenu[/ICODE], [ICODE]openPurchaseMenu[/ICODE] are safe from async threads (manager switches back to Bukkit).
[*] [ICODE]getMenuManager()[/ICODE] exposes the GUI controller; [ICODE]getDao()[/ICODE] grants direct DB access for custom workflows.
[*] Check [ICODE]api.areAuctionsEnabled()[/ICODE] before exposing custom commands.
[/LIST]
[CODE=java]
if (api.areAuctionsEnabled()) {
    api.auctions().openMainMenu(player);

    AuctionDao dao = api.auctions().getDao();
    if (dao != null) {
        dao.listByCreator(dao.fetchUserId(player.getName()))
                .forEach(item -> getLogger().info(item.getCustomTitle()));
    }
} else {
    player.sendMessage("Auctions are disabled on this server.");
}
[/CODE]

[HR][/HR]

Keep this BBCode snippet handy for your XenForo resource page or developer wiki. Update it whenever the API grows so third‑party developers always know how to integrate with ZonelyCore.
